WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.912
Section 1.

00:00:01.862 --> 00:00:04.287
The Big Three Oligopoly.

00:00:04.287 --> 00:00:09.450
Canada's media landscape isn't a marketplace of ideas, it's a cartel.

00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:14.925
The same company that sells your internet connection also owns the television network.

00:00:14.925 --> 00:00:17.350
Who is holding whom accountable?
